# ================================================================================
# Kubernetes Security Audit - Progress Checkpoint Log
# ================================================================================
# 
# Purpose: Tracks audit completion percentage and phase information at regular
#          intervals to enable 4-hour deadline monitoring and scope management.
#
# Log Format: [HH:MM] Progress: <percentage>% complete (<phase description>)
#
# Checkpoint Milestones:
#   10%  - Environment setup complete (Go 1.25.0, Trivy 0.69.0, gosec 2.22.11, Semgrep 1.150.0)
#   25%  - Trivy dependency scan complete (SBOM generated, vulnerability DB checked)
#   50%  - gosec analysis complete (Go AST/SSA security scanning finished)
#   75%  - Semgrep analysis complete (multi-language pattern matching done)
#   90%  - Report aggregation complete (SARIF merge, CSV export, deduplication)
#   100% - Audit complete (all deliverables generated, validation passed)
#
# Time Constraint Monitoring:
#   - Target audit duration: ≤4 hours (240 minutes)
#   - Progress checkpoints logged every 30 minutes
#   - EARLY WARNING: If 3.5 hours (210 minutes) elapsed with <80% progress,
#     trigger automatic scope reduction to Critical/High severity findings only
#
# Scope Reduction Protocol (triggered at 3.5h with <80% progress):
#   1. Abort Medium/Low severity scanning
#   2. Complete Critical/High severity analysis only
#   3. Generate abbreviated executive summary (top 20 findings)
#   4. Document time constraint impact in limitations section
#
# Log Population Function (executed by audit runner):
#   log_progress() {
#     local percentage=$1
#     local phase=$2
#     echo "[$(date +%H:%M)] Progress: ${percentage}% complete (${phase})" \
#       >> /audit-results/logs/progress.log
#   }
#
# Usage Examples:
#   log_progress 10 "Environment setup complete"
#   log_progress 25 "Trivy dependency scan complete"
#   log_progress 50 "gosec analysis complete"
#   log_progress 75 "Semgrep analysis complete"
#   log_progress 90 "Report aggregation complete"
#   log_progress 100 "Audit complete"
#
# Repository: github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes
# Branch: main
# ================================================================================

